    num: 'Gate 3',
    title: 'Proof of value',
    body: 'Find the most recent official placement report for the exact institute you are targeting, and talk to one person who graduated from it in the last two years. Compare what they actually got against what the brochure promised. The gap between those two numbers is the real risk you are pricing.',
