  <h2 id="who-should-not">Who should not do an MBA right after BCom</h2>

  <p>
    This is the section most "should I do an MBA" articles skip entirely, because it is not a good
    sales pitch for a coaching institute. It is, however, the section that saves people two years
    and a five-figure or six-figure loan.
  </p>

