    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      Recruiters in post-MBA consulting and strategy roles are already screening for AI proficiency
      alongside the traditional case-interview skill set. The safest position over the next decade
      is not "avoid AI tools during your MBA." It is becoming the person who directs AI-assisted
      research and analysis while owning the judgment call, the client relationship, and the final
      recommendation a tool cannot be accountable for. That is exactly the kind of
      <strong>holistic skill portfolio</strong> — technical comfort plus judgment plus
      communication — that turns a management degree into durable income instead of a plateaued
      title.
    </p>
  </div>

